/**
 * Static catalog of AI modes and skill metadata.
 *
 * The mode list is the source of truth for the five built-in behaviours
 * (ask / edit / agent / debug / review). Skills are loaded from the
 * backend at runtime via {@link fetchSkills}; the generated file under
 * ``../generated/skills.ts`` is the build-time mirror of the registry
 * and is the dev-mode fallback when the bridge is not connected.
 */
